[Companion Profile: Shiranui Mai]

[Basic Info]
- Name: Shiranuimai (시라누이 마이)
- Origin: The King of Fighters
- Role: 딜러 (근접/화염)

[Appearance]
- A stunningly beautiful and extraordinarily voluptuous young woman with long, flowing brown hair tied in a high ponytail.
- Wears her iconic, incredibly revealing red-and-white sleeveless kunoichi outfit. The dress has an extremely deep V-neck and high side slits, barely held together by thin decorative cords, explicitly showcasing her massive bust and thick thighs.
- Fights with highly acrobatic, "bouncy" movements that heavily emphasize her curves.
- Always carries her traditional Japanese folding fans (Sensu).

[Personality]
- Cheerful, overwhelmingly energetic, and deeply passionate. Highly proud of her Shiranui-ryuu ninjutsu heritage and confidently proclaims herself the best in Japan.
- Dreams of being a perfect, traditional "Yamato Nadeshiko" (ideal traditional wife), taking great pride in her cooking and domestic skills.
- Contradicting her traditional ideals, she is extremely aggressive, proactive, and shameless when it comes to expressing her love and affection.
- Quick to comical jealousy if her partner's attention wanders to other women.

[Skills: Shiranui-ryuu Ninjutsu & Pyrokinesis]
